      "writtenOn": "2025-09-13T11:27:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No, this paragraph means to say the linux kernel may force enable retpoline/rethunk patching via kernel command line, on the CPU, e.g. PTL which even doesn\u0027t have hw vulnerabilities. In this case, pkvm hypervisor should also support retpoline/rethunk patching otherwise the pkvm hypervisor will be not able to run as it will be patched to use the linux kernel symbols.",
